flowchart TD
    A[Admission Deposit] --> B[Charge Accumulation]
    B --> C{Bill > 80% Deposits?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Create First Demand]
    C -->|No| E[Continue Processing]
    D --> F{48-Hour Deadline?}
    F -->|Bill > 80%| G[Create Second Demand]
    F -->|Bill <= 80%| H[Demand Lapsed]
    G --> I[Activate Procedure Block]
    I --> J{Procedure Command?}
    J -->|Emergency| K[Allow Procedure]
    J -->|Non-Emergency| L[Reject TOPUP_BLOCK]
    K --> M[Continue Processing]
    L --> M
    J2[Deposit Payment] --> N{Demand Satisfied?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Close Demand]
    N -->|No| P[Reduce Outstanding]
    O --> Q{Lift Procedure Block?}
    Q -->|All demands closed| R[Block Lifted]
    Q -->|Open demands remain| S[Block Continues]
